WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.367
Every AI sounds sure of itself.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.010
Even when it's wrong.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.535
So ask them all at once.

4
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.647
One question. Four models.

5
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.343
Each answers on its own.

6
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:15.887
Then they grade each other, blind.

7
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.872
One verdict comes back.

8
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.358
With every mistake the panel caught.

9
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:29.472
Quick. Review. Deep. Saver.

10
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.493
Then hand the work to your agents.

11
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.100
Private by design.

12
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.295
Each key goes only to its own company.

13
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.084
Put your AI models to work, together.
